------------------------------------------------------------------------------
no-ai-slop
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product includes rule definitions derived from no-ai-slop
(https://github.com/petergyang/no-ai-slop), Copyright (c) 2026 Peter Yang,
licensed under the MIT License.

The word list split across Voices/Banned.yml and Voices/InflatedWords.yml, and
the patterns in Voices/BinaryContrast.yml, Voices/ThroatClearing.yml,
Voices/Puffery.yml, Voices/Weasel.yml, Voices/Recap.yml,
Voices/SuperficialAnalysis.yml, Voices/ColonReveal.yml and
Voices/WeakVerbs.yml were transcribed from that project's SKILL.md, which
enumerates them as prose. The rules here are a translation of those lists into
Vale's check syntax, and the replacements attached to the swappable half are
this project's own. The judgment the skill also carries -- what to preserve,
when a hedge is honest, how much to change -- is not reproducible as a rule and
stays with the original.

