awesome-claude-output-styles
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product includes voice definitions shaped after the output styles
catalogued in awesome-claude-output-styles
(https://github.com/smixs/awesome-claude-output-styles), Copyright (c) 2026
Serge Shima, licensed under the MIT License.

Direct and Coach each take the constraint its entry describes and state it as
a Vale rule. Where a style enumerates vocabulary, the terms are in general use
and were listed independently.
